WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.626
Being busy is not the same as producing a

00:00:02.718 --> 00:00:07.322
useful result You have separated known facts from assumptions

00:00:08.244 --> 00:00:13.125
Next define what the support must actually deliver Sending

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:17.284
an invitation is familiar work But the executive may

00:00:17.349 --> 00:00:22.113
need a decision-ready pack not another calendar entry If

00:00:22.113 --> 00:00:25.428
an input is missing the invitation alone does not

00:00:25.507 --> 00:00:28.810
make the meeting ready We will turn the business

00:00:28.863 --> 00:00:30.705
purpose into a support brief
